  "title": "Epigame: demo",
  "description": "An open-ended game about how an infection moves through a group. There is no last day; the outbreak runs until the study is shut down. Your phone records a random code for each nearby participant and how close they were, nothing else. It does not record where you are. Some of the people in the game are simulated, so that a small group still produces an outbreak worth playing; the information screen explains which parts are real.",
